<title>NIGERIA: UAC Nigeria 1996 full year profit drops.</title>
<headline>UAC Nigeria 1996 full year profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year audited result for Anglo-Nigerian conglomerate UAC Nigeria Plc to end-December 1996. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996	 1995</p>
<p>     Turnover		12,100     10,300</p>
<p>     Profit before tax    1,000	1,100</p>
<p>     Taxation		 300.8	327.7</p>
<p>     Profit after tax     788.3	861.5</p>
<p>Dividend - The company has proposed to pay 70 kobo per share compared with 80 kobo per share for the previous year. ($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
